{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640065","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640065","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1064006501:0":{"text":"かなり手こずったが、なんとかミラージュイーグルモスを倒すことができた。","source_cn":"经过一场艰苦的战斗，你们击败了幻瞳鹰蛾。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x724BCDDCBDE4B5E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064006502:0":{"text":"だが、程度の差はあれど、それぞれが精神攻撃でダメージを負い、かなり疲弊してしまった。","source_cn":"尽管取得了胜利，但每个人都或多或少地受到了精神冲击，陷...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064006503:1":{"text":"頭痛が……誰かが頭の中で太鼓を叩いているみたい……","source_cn":"头好痛……感觉有人在脑子里打鼓……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD72F4E418E1F4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064006504:0":{"text":"手足に力が入らない……これが精神攻撃か？","source_cn":"四肢都使不上力气……这就是精神创伤吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x389DC8DF1876D083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1064006504":{"text":"手足に力が入らない……これが精神攻撃か？","source_cn":"四肢都使不上力气……这就是精神创伤吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x389DC8DF1876D083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064006505:0":{"text":"温泉！？入りたい！","source_cn":"温泉？！我要去！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x4ECFF9360A8F7668","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064006506:0":{"text":"あったかいお湯にゆっくり浸かりたい！","source_cn":"我需要好好泡个温泉！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBDE4E9A1969B9474","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1064006507:1":{"text":"ライオスたちをシロクマ温泉旅館に案内した。そこでは女将のガルダと、クインが出迎えてくれた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1064006508:1":{"text":"町を危機から救ったあなたは、この温泉旅館の生涯無料パスを贈呈されたVIP客なのだ。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064006509:1":{"text":"シロクマ温泉旅館へようこそ！","source_cn":"欢迎各位来到白熊温泉旅店！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x433333CACB79BE9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064006510:1":{"text":"必要な物はこちらで用意してありますので、ご自由にお入りください！","source_cn":"相关用品我已经准备好了，请随意使用！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x61966940590A86A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064006511:1":{"text":"ご用入りの際はいつでもお呼びくださいね。この耳は、何一つ聞き逃しませんので！","source_cn":"有什么需要随时叫我，我都能听到！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x85819E5ABEBB74EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064006512:0":{"text":"では、わたくしはこれにて下がらせていただきますね、ご主人様。","source_cn":"你们的管家洛桑先告退了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7F06DD729B2AB701","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064006513:0":{"text":"……クインさんったら、どこであんな接客を覚えたんでしょう？","source_cn":"……洛桑从哪学的这一套？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD5AC800F63E1063E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064006514:0":{"text":"高級温泉旅館の研修に出されて、最新の接客術を身につけてきましたっ！","source_cn":"我被送去了另一家豪华温泉旅馆进修！学习了最新的服务技巧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE76B3ADC817D7137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064006515:1":{"text":"すごい。あんな遠くにいるのに、本当に耳がいいのね……","source_cn":"他的兔耳朵也太灵敏了，离这么远还能听到我们说话。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD6CBB7E66DE1B2FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1064006515":{"text":"すごい。あんな遠くにいるのに、本当に耳がいいのね……","source_cn":"他的兔耳朵也太灵敏了，离这么远还能听到我们说话。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD6CBB7E66DE1B2FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064006516:1":{"text":"風語りは、風から遠くの音を聞き取れるんですよ。","source_cn":"风语者能从风中倾听到远方的声音。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3822F08587A7BDD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064006517:1":{"text":"チルチャックの聴覚もすごいぞ。風語りとどっちがよく聞こえるかな？","source_cn":"齐尔查克的听觉也很好呢，不知道跟风语者比如何？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF25E240C49CAF11D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064006518:1":{"text":"……俺のは種族の特徴だ。そういう特殊能力じゃねえよ。","source_cn":"……我这是种族特性，不是这种特殊能力啦。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xECEBDA556685F090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064006519:1":{"text":"今はそれよりも、はやく温泉に入ろう。","source_cn":"别想这些了，快去泡温泉吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF93234A45A08A5BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064006520:1":{"text":"何も考えずに湯に浸かって、さっきの戦いで見た恐ろしい幻影を全部洗い流したい……","source_cn":"我只想泡进温泉里什么都不想，把刚刚战斗时看到的恐怖幻影...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:32:1064006521:0":{"text":"各々が支度を済ませ、ゆっくり温泉を楽しんだ。温かい湯水に包まれ、疲れがたちまち解けていく。","source_cn":"你们各自做好了准备进入了温泉池，温热的泉水立刻缓解了大...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:33:1064006522:0":{"text":"しばらくして、温泉を楽しんだあなたたちは、傍にある休憩スペースで一息つきながらお喋りを始めた。","source_cn":"过了许久，你们泡完了温泉，聚在一旁的休息区聊天。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x22CB4FFFB6974544","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064006523:0":{"text":"迷宮の中にも温泉があるといいな……","source_cn":"迷宫里要是也有温泉就好了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x81B9E74912A2C35E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064006524:0":{"text":"そんな簡単に作れるわけないでしょ、迷宮の構造はすごく複雑なんだから。","source_cn":"哪有那么容易，迷宫的空间构造可是很复杂的。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7409FD16310777D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064006525:1":{"text":"チルチャックはもう少し魔術の常識を学びなさい。","source_cn":"齐尔查克，你真应该补点魔法常识了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B3EF758296D09C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064006526:1":{"text":"それと、センシ。ヒゲを洗うのを忘れないでね。","source_cn":"森西，泡完记得洗胡子。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3BCD23E1579F0D45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064006527:1":{"text":"……分かった。","source_cn":"……知道了。<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x657A10B5D77F1348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064006528:1":{"text":"私もあとで髪の手入れをしなくちゃ。","source_cn":"我待会也要好好护理头发呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B8C81E42346B16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064006529:1":{"text":"髪と言えば……マーリンさんの髪の毛ってすっごくツヤツヤだけど、普段はどんなふうに手入れをしてるの？","source_cn":"说到这个……梅林，你的头发好有光泽，平时都是怎么保养的啊？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8DE5D4DB8CCD5558","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:46:1064006529":{"text":"髪と言えば……マーリンさんの髪の毛ってすっごくツヤツヤだけど、普段はどんなふうに手入れをしてるの？","source_cn":"说到这个……梅林，你的头发好有光泽，平时都是怎么保养的啊？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8DE5D4DB8CCD5558","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064006530:1":{"text":"ええ！？そんな便利な魔術があるなんて……","source_cn":"什么？！这能力也太作弊了吧。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x6BEE184A0D10D660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064006531:1":{"text":"マスターは外見だって自由に変えられますよ。","source_cn":"主人还能随意改变长相。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x59D4984D3AB588D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064006532:1":{"text":"えええー！？う、羨ましい……！","source_cn":"可恶，可恶！好嫉妒！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x464127126D458CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064006533:1":{"text":"私も、そういう高位魔術を使えるようになりたいなあ。","source_cn":"我也想学这种高级魔法！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x80E6A07EB6B4741E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064006534:1":{"text":"迷宮の中じゃ、身だしなみを整える余裕なんてないし……","source_cn":"在迷宫里，外表总是很难打理……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0EF188906302E328","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064006535:1":{"text":"ゆっくり休む暇もほとんどないしな。","source_cn":"还总是没时间好好休息。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x55465FA384A81201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064006536:1":{"text":"それが、こうして温泉に浸かれるとは、まさに僥倖だな。","source_cn":"现在能享受温泉，也算是难得的惊喜了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x128660ECF30B792B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064006537:0":{"text":"そうだな。こういう時間も、大事だよな……","source_cn":"说得也是，这种时刻真该好好珍惜啊……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA4F3304DC9B523DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:62:1064006538:0":{"text":"こうして、精神攻撃によるダメージは徐々に消えていった。","source_cn":"随着时间推移，精神创伤带来的疲惫渐渐消退。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD95D431E4EB7915E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:63:1064006539:0":{"text":"しばらくして、クインが夕食の準備ができたことを知らせに来た。","source_cn":"与此同时，“管家”洛桑，也为你们准备好了晚餐——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x33A34AD208BA4098","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064006540:1":{"text":"さあ、ご主人様方、この町の名物――鹿肉餃子のサワークリーム添えでございます。","source_cn":"各位超级贵宾，请尝尝我们雪松镇的特色——鹿肉饺蘸酸奶油。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2336647610CE6D68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:65::2":{"text":"鹿肉餃子とパンナ・コッタ","source_cn":"麋鹿饺蘸酸奶油与冰晶莓奶冻","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x322E35ADA64CB43B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064006541:1":{"text":"おお、いい匂い！","source_cn":"好香！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC4E267003F95D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064006542:1":{"text":"ふむ、鹿肉とサワークリームの風味が完璧に合わさっているな。","source_cn":"嗯，鹿肉的野味与酸奶油完美融合。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1AC542CB72A24E91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064006543:0":{"text":"それから、こちらものアイスベリーパンナ・コッタもどうぞ！わたくしの奢りです！","source_cn":"还有这个！冰晶莓奶冻，这是我自掏腰包赠送给各位贵宾的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x34A8623B6B921853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","